layer=lampforge_matsexplain_layer
textfont=museo_sans_11pt_regular
text=There are many types of Crablets. Rusty, Scarlet and Azure boost your XP by 10, 20 and 30% repectively. The rarer types Silver and Gold give 40% and 50%. Chromatic crablets give you a 60% boost and are the most valuable. If you are lucky, you will be able to catch multiple types at the same time to gain a truly amazing boost!<br><br>If you mouse over the icons, they will tell you what they do.
